<title>HONG KONG: Hana Bank launches US$75 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Hana Bank launches US$75 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate</p>
<p>certificates of deposit issue was announced by the arrangers.</p>
<p>BORROWER  HANA BANK*</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$75 MLN COUPON	6ML+35BP   MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRCD	ISS PRICE   PAR	  RE-OFFER  --</p>
<p> PUTS	YR 1 &amp; 2  CALLS	 YR 1 &amp; 2   LAUNCH    23.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING   NONE	REPAYMENT   BULLET     REPLIES   14.JUL.97</p>
<p> RATING    --	  SALES LMTS  CUSTOMARY  DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p> NEG PLG   --	  CRS DEF     --	   FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> GOV LAW   ENGLISH   HOME CTRY   S.KOREA    PAY DATE  30.JUL.97</p>
<p>PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUALLY</p>
<p>MGT FEES AND LEVELS**</p>
<p> CO-LEAD MANAGERS    US$5 MLN+   16BP   ALL-IN  51</p>
<p> SENIOR MANAGERS     US$2-4 MLN  15BP   ALL-IN  50</p>
<p>ARRANGERS  BANK AUSTRIA, COMMERZ (EAST ASIA) (AGENT),</p>
<p>		DEVELOPMENT BANK OF SINGAPORE, DRESDNER (SOUTH EAST</p>
<p>		ASIA), TOKYO-MITSUBISHI INTERNATIONAL (HK) (JAPANESE</p>
<p>		BOOKS) AND WESTLB ASIA PACIFIC (NON-JAPANESE BOOKS)</p>
<p> NOTES	* ISSUE FULLY UNDERWRITTEN BY THE ARRANGERS.</p>
<p>		** BASED ON ONE-YEAR TERM</p>
<p>		PROCEEDS FOR GENERAL FUNDING REQUIREMENT.</p>
<p>		CLEARING THROUGH EUROCLEAR/CEDEL.</p>
<p>		SIGNING SET FOR JULY 23.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
